# Antigravity Build Prompt — Section Variant Template

> Ye reusable template hai. Har naye section/design ke liye sirf **PART A** (design + section) aur
> **PART C** (variant specs) bharo. **PART B (Locked Rules)** kabhi mat badalna — ye poore project
> ke hard-won rules hain, har build mein same rehte hain.
>
> Flow: Umang ek design deta hai → Claude PART A ka base spec + PART C ke 5-6 structural variant
> specs likhta hai → ye poora prompt Antigravity ko paste hota hai → Antigravity Liquid banata hai.

