## PART D — Delivery + proof (Antigravity must return)

1. Har variant ka `.liquid` file (+ koi naye snippet).
2. Ek chhota **self-check** har variant ke liye: "no hardcoded hex/radius (grep clean), token names match chassis,
   responsive both breakpoints, no fabricated data, missing-image fallback present."
3. **Render proof — real, viewable.** Screenshots LOCAL WINDOWS PATH pe mat do (woh render nahi hote).
   Ek `shopify theme dev` / `theme share` / admin-preview **link** do jise Umang khud khol ke dekh sake,
   ya proper uploaded image. Verification Umang ki aankh se close hoti hai, self-certified "done" se nahi.
4. Do sabse contrasting variants side-by-side dikhao taaki structural difference clearly proven ho.